	// client opens it, declares which targets it serves, and then waits to be
	// told what to deliver. That direction is deliberate. Invariant I1 requires
	// EFFECT_RELEASING to be appended durably *before* the delivery is attempted,
	// and only this process can append — so the decision to deliver, the ordering
	// around it, the retry budget and the poisoning all stay here. A client that
